{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c807976f6b40d658a6effe915f9ea7296dd2e266c71f27061b47fa8558740cd1", "ja": "（いよいよ765プロ劇場のこけら落とし公演当日だ。\nさて、アイドル達の様子は……）", "zh": "（终于到了765艺能剧场开幕公演当天。\n我来看一下偶像们的情况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "6d511afb4020fcbce9ddb9a81940c9476db60777f2771594c2cba338ddb2e4a1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、\nちょうどいいところに！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，\n你来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b17cbdea20d5cb09a5f140e848a0e8f87d0db9a8ab6c3483e07ae4018c98c439", "ja": "律子？　どうしたんだ？\nまさか、何かトラブルでも……。", "zh": "律子？怎么啦？\n该不会出了什么状况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "c4b9ca6111d3d453cd36bc6546b85995637644c4c625ee42e4793fd8cadb80f7", "ja": "いえ、トラブルは別に何も。\n準備は万端、いつでもライブに望めますよ！", "zh": "不，没出什么状况。\n准备很万全，演唱会随时都能开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "e179d536a4df2a4bddfc0b7a0836e08315ed42b3c8914cd8126de6488c5137a7", "ja": "ただ、新人の子達がちょっと緊張してるみたいで、\nそのことを伝えようと思って。", "zh": "只不过，新人们好像有点紧张。\n我是想跟你说这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "26c6d75f2d661b54a49f49987351cd1c25b9a41c7b56d68375ad1bbc08d4db55", "ja": "{$P$}。\nみんなのサポート、お願いしますね。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n再麻烦你去支援大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "7e5ce199282ee6d3a779f5053897288fe0ca6252f002ebdfa2692a0546375a6c", "ja": "私も気をつけますけど、{$P$}が\n声をかけてあげた方が、落ち着くかなと思って。", "zh": "虽然我也有在关心她们，但如果是\n{$P$}去搭话，她们应该会比较冷静。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c4557ef26c2b285ae945e89ed97bbbd3f177b502df0142b3a07f2049574fd788", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n律子、教えてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "这样啊。\n律子，谢谢你告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "84f64c88f8d90f4dc1c5f459a7d6fcfb3c1724bf9f4f5256ffe7f08494536f27", "ja": "いえいえ。\n先輩として当然のことをしたまでです♪", "zh": "不会不会。\n我只是做了身为前辈该做的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2cdb256e1221d323df4180bf3c2d837f53a4d4c456a28229cea47d0afc6652c8", "ja": "それで、律子自身はどうなんだ？\n緊張してないのか？", "zh": "那律子你自己怎么样呢？\n你不会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "0bf3a40aafa36c6425906ae93abfdc2b088513474336a11de1399b53eaf2b7a1", "ja": "もう全く問題ありません！\n任せてください！", "zh": "完全没问题！\n一切都交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "b25c2e6f70de7e99511acc47e54d86224967c3df40e6f3d540644867ba74b385", "ja": "と、言いたいところなんですけど……。\nさすがに緊張してますね、あはは。", "zh": "虽然很想这么说啦……\n但果然还是会紧张呢，哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "92e136a84ee848fcb2177ec1c6e18ec0cdf975129ee9c83ab18ccb3235f525f4", "ja": "まあ、そうだよな。\n俺もさすがに緊張してるし。", "zh": "我想也是啦。\n连我自己也都很紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "6b8268cd4dc63472be670253e6f1eafb4c40017ed18e5351454f5f3d4314cc7a", "ja": "そうでなきゃ困ります。\n何が起こるかわからないのがライブなんですから。", "zh": "这是难免的嘛，\n因为演唱会就是无法预料会发生什么事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "5b8b9b90c415615732b02f6e2cb29c606d7285b7e6ed3a91a524d4f72994e98d", "ja": "でも……今日までに努力してきたこと、\n重ねてきた経験は、私を裏切らないはず。", "zh": "不过……至今为止我付出的努力、\n累积的经验，应该都不会背叛我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "490f22039d50eb0dc4a4a9741c3cd79788d3b86491cd8f5769574a4218a04631", "ja": "それに、今日まで一緒に歩いてきた仲間もいますから。\n私達なら大丈夫！　と思ってます♪", "zh": "而且还有一路互相扶持的伙伴们陪着。\n我想我们应该没问题的！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "adc2d740003da5ea5f3a86104aedfd0dc2571bb6e0327206680bc610a63c0ac4", "ja": "はは、正直なところ、俺も同じかな。\n律子達のフォローがある以上、たぶん大丈夫だ！", "zh": "哈哈，老实说我也这么认为呢。\n既然有律子你们的支援，肯定没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "b839addee61371c28c2eee503a570bb194d507213ca99ebba1c051caeb7759b2", "ja": "そ、そこまで言い切られるのも困りますけど……。\nま、新人の子達には自信を持ってもらいたいし。", "zh": "你、你说得那么肯定，让我很伤脑筋……\n不过还是希望新人们能多点信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "0a82b1261f157f2558fe4ffdb943c28eab11e3856d370748c93ee2e25cc282e4", "ja": "ご要望通り、私達がきっちり支えてみせますっ！\nふふっ。", "zh": "如你所愿，我们会尽力支援的！\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4ce7baf54e4549800b3bd0b2be66e70aa27bd2ea5f73c05644ee13abb0886985", "ja": "期待してるよ。ただ……。", "zh": "我很期待喔。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "16be6b7d28caded218b9e0add8d62f768b683e4030b05cdf55683c31797b28f7", "ja": "ただ……なんですか？", "zh": "不过……什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4d5dba86b37d69481f0c730aa11a9a3c009610b0094e1f105fd8ed38f569702b", "ja": "周りや全体を気にし過ぎて、\n自分のことを忘れないようにな？", "zh": "你可别太在意周遭和大局，\n反而忘了自己的事喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "200f2088362ed94ba9411b36887fcff4fc053d99eb959fa3870a8f7e2ae4ff35", "ja": "……忘れてたのか？", "zh": "……你忘了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "c2837b77461c60c72dcb1ab0d95e58a1b7a574066afac3e0ba3c296d31bdd2a5", "ja": "わ、忘れるワケないじゃないですか！\nまずは自分のことをキッチリと。うん、当然当然！", "zh": "我、我怎么可能会忘！\n首先要做好自已的事。嗯，当然当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "3517af74a568dbe9386ec826a4758ef2d8066d4165a221ddc94d90ded9967ed0", "ja": "それじゃ、行ってきますね～！　自分のことも、\n周りのことも。……まとめて面倒みて来ます♪", "zh": "那我过去啰～！\n自己和周遭……我都会顾好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fc4f75cecf1f488f472c3d5267f2c44604e71e25ef6d943291031f1d297b9002", "ja": "（宣材撮影の時もそうだったが、律子はみんなの\nサポートを中心に振る舞いがちなところがある……）", "zh": "（拍宣传照时也是一样，\n律子似乎常以支援大家为优先……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_009rit_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_009rit_003_1027_p", "source_sha256": "40b8d44e8b1399ebc9077aa7243076829276f5257ba6279fc91e19e700de84ef", "ja": "（頼もしいんだけど、周囲のことばかり気にするんじゃ\nなくて、もっと自分のことを考えてもいいのにな）", "zh": "（虽然很可靠，但真希望她别只顾着\n在意周遭的事，也要多替自己想想啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
